# {{PROJECT_NAME}}

{{PROJECT_DESCRIPTION}} A Nautobot App built and evolved via the unattended (Lane B) Claude Code pipeline: label an issue `claude-go` and `.github/workflows/claude.yml` implements it, opens a PR, and records the run in `docs/journal.md`.

## Development

Requires a local Nautobot install to verify APIs against. Dependencies are managed with Poetry:

```
poetry install
poetry run nautobot-server migrate
poetry run nautobot-server test {{PYTHON_PACKAGE}}
```

